Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:27:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: qcom,ipa: Add SM6450 compatible
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SM6450 has IPA v5.2, like Milos, but gives the modem a smaller share of
shared memory for its filter tables, so it cannot fall back to the Milos
compatible and needs one of its own.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
index ccb7eb315..957aded4f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/qcom,ipa.yaml
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@ properties:
           - qcom,sdx55-ipa
           - qcom,sdx65-ipa
           - qcom,sm6350-ipa
+          - qcom,sm6450-ipa
           - qcom,sm8350-ipa
           - qcom,sm8550-ipa
       - items:
